ord)","bold":true}],[{"text":"endmodule","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":true}]],"bugLine":19,"fixLine":"if (rst)       led <= 1'b0;"},{"id":"dead-report-na","itemId":"board-checklist","role":"core","promptHtml":"A build of <code class=\"nobreak\">tick_led</code> finished with no error. Below is the Design Timing Summary of its timing summary.","explanationHtml":"<p><code class=\"nobreak\">NA</code>, not applicable: the line under it says there are no timing constraints, so Vivado timed no path and has no slack to report. A summary with no failing path can be one that checked nothing; look for the line that says every constraint is met.</p>","type":"report","source":"vivado/reports/tick_led_noclock/arty-a7-100t/timing_summary.rpt","firstLine":139,"excerpt":["    WNS(ns)      TNS(ns)  TNS Failing Endpoints  TNS Total Endpoints      WHS(ns)      THS(ns)  THS Failing Endpoints  THS Total Endpoints     WPWS(ns)     TPWS(ns)  TPWS Failing Endpoints  TPWS Total Endpoints  ","    -------      -------  ---------------------  -------------------      -------      -------  ---------------------  -------------------     --------     --------  ----------------------  --------------------  ","         NA           NA                     NA                   NA           NA           NA                     NA                   NA           NA           NA                      NA                    NA  ","","","There are no user specified timing constraints."],"ask":"What does the report give for WNS?","answer":"NA","numeric":false},{"id":"dead-fill-last","itemId":"board-checklist","role":"core","promptHtml":"A learner believed the board's clock ran at 50 MHz. Their constraints file for <code class=\"nobreak\">tick_led</code> says <code>create_clock -period 20.00</code>, and they set <code class=\"nobreak\">LAST</code> to 49,999,999 so that LD4 would change once a second. On the board, LD4 changes twice a second. Fill in the <code class=\"nobreak\">LAST</code> that makes it change once a second.","explanationHtml":"<p><code class=\"nobreak\">99_999_999</code>. A <code class=\"nobreak\">create_clock</code> line only describes the clock to Vivado (lesson 7.2): the board's oscillator runs at 100 MHz whatever the file says, so a second is 100,000,000 cycles and the count runs from 0 to 99,999,999. The learner's count was half a second of the real clock. Checking the parameters against the clock the board has, the first check of lesson 7.4, would have caught it, and their period should say 10.00.</p>","type":"fill","file":"hdl/level-04/tick_led/tick_led.sv","firstLine":5,"totalLines":23,"before":["module tick_led #(","  parameter int              BITS = 27,"],"blankLine":{"left":"  parameter logic [BITS-1:0] LAST = ","right":""},"after":[") ("],"highlighted":{"before":[[{"text":"module","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":true},{"text":" ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"tick_led","color":"var(--code-token-function)","bold":false},{"text":" ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"#","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":false},{"text":"(","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false}],[{"text":"  ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"parameter","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":true},{"text":" ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"int","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":true},{"text":"              BITS ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"=","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":false},{"text":" ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"27","color":"var(--code-token-constant)","bold":false},{"text":",","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false}]],"blankLine":{"left":[{"text":"  ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"parameter","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":true},{"text":" ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"logic","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":true},{"text":" [BITS","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"-","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":false},{"text":"1","color":"var(--code-token-constant)","bold":false},{"text":":","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":false},{"text":"0","color":"var(--code-token-constant)","bold":false},{"text":"] LAST ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false},{"text":"=","color":"var(--code-token-keyword)","bold":false},{"text":" ","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false}],"right":[]},"after":[[{"text":") (","color":"var(--code-foreground)","bold":false}]]},"accept":["99_999_999","99999999","27'd99_999_999","27'd99999999"],"caseSensitive":true,"blankLabel":"The value of LAST"}]